 "stem": "Factorise the following expression over the set of complex numbers. ${=a}x^4+{=b}x^2-{=c}$",
 "answer": "{=a}*(x - sqrt({=p}))*(x + sqrt({=p}))*(x - i*sqrt({=q}))*(x + i*sqrt({=q}))",
 "solution": [
  "Take out the leading coefficient: ${=a}x^4+{=b}x^2-{=c}={=a}(x^4+{=q-p}x^2-{=p*q})={=a}(x^2-{=p})(x^2+{=q})$.",
  "$x^2-{=p}=0$ gives $x=\\pm\\sqrt{{=p}}$, so $x^2-{=p}=(x-\\sqrt{{=p}})(x+\\sqrt{{=p}})$.",
  "$x^2+{=q}=0$ gives $x=\\pm i\\sqrt{{=q}}$, so $x^2+{=q}=(x-i\\sqrt{{=q}})(x+i\\sqrt{{=q}})$.",
  "Answer: ${=a}(x-\\sqrt{{=p}})(x+\\sqrt{{=p}})(x-i\\sqrt{{=q}})(x+i\\sqrt{{=q}})$."
 ],
 "marker": {
